                  "name": "onFloorDesc",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFFCC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "On-floor members live on the Engineering House floor in DSP. You'll enjoy an open-door culture with access to the VAX workshop, study lounges, pool lounge, and a tight-knit community of fellow engineers right next door.",
