              "content": "Have other questions? Email ehouserecruitment@gmail.com",
              "lineHeight": 1.375,
              "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "normal",
              "letterSpacing": 0.32
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ETE6n",
          "name": "FAQ Content",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#ebf2fa",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 16,
          "padding": [
            64,
            200
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "KPCcv",
              "name": "q1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "bO0pO",
                  "name": "q1Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "What are the benefits of joining Engineering House?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "nGg7k",
                  "name": "q1Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Engineering House offers a supportive community of like-minded students, access to workshop spaces, study lounges, social events throughout the year, ImagineRIT project opportunities, and lifelong friendships with fellow engineers.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "gam7n",
              "name": "q2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hTRf2",
                  "name": "q2Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "What are the commitment expectations?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "E3OJ6",
                  "name": "q2Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "We expect members to participate in house activities and contribute to the community. This includes attending house meetings, participating in events, and maintaining a positive presence on the floor.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "8FgBm",
              "name": "q3",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "alvcx",
                  "name": "q3Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "Is Engineering House one floor? What is it?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ymmE7",
                  "name": "q3Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Engineering House is a Special Interest House (SIH) that occupies one floor in DSP (formerly NRH). It's a living-learning community where students who are passionate about engineering and technology live together.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "t8T3p",
              "name": "q4",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Vw3Ig",
                  "name": "q4Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "What is the off-floor member experience like?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "5QxMe",
                  "name": "q4Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Off-floor members participate in all the same events and have access to the same resources. The recruitment chair helps off-floor members stay connected with the community, and there may be opportunities to move on-floor if spots become available.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "CgWTN",
              "name": "q5",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "USSP4",
                  "name": "q5Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "What if I already selected a roommate before acceptance?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "094Kt",
                  "name": "q5Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "No worries! You can still join Engineering House. Talk to the recruitment chair about your specific situation and we'll work with you to find the best arrangement.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Lxp9t",
              "name": "q6",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Nm21i",
                  "name": "q6Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "How much does it cost to join?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HH2Vx",
                  "name": "q6Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Off-floor membership is $40/semester and on-floor membership is $90/semester. These dues go toward house events, supplies, and improvements.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "faJ0r",
              "name": "q7",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#ebf2faff",
              "cornerRadius": 15,
              "stroke": {
                "thickness": 1,
                "fill": "#024889ff"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "padding": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "oBJmE",
                  "name": "q7Title",
                  "fill": "#091820ff",
                  "content": "How do I join?",
                  "fontFamily": "Horizon",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AVogk",
                  "name": "q7Ans",
                  "fill": "#091820cc",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Apply through your RIT housing contract during room selection. List Engineering House as your preference. A selection committee reviews applications. You can also reach out to ehouserecruitment@gmail.com for more information.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "Alexandria",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 0.32
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
