                  "name": "offFloorDesc",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFFCC",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Off-floor members have access to all the same events, resources, and community — just without living on the floor. The recruitment chair will work with you to find ways to stay connected, and if a spot opens up, you may have the opportunity to move on-floor.",
